<title>FRANCE: SAT joins SBF 120, Landanger Camus joins.</title>
<headline>SAT joins SBF 120, Landanger Camus joins.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French stock markets association SBF said on Monday it was replacing Roussel Uclaf with SAT in its SBF 120 share index and with Landanger Camus in its SBF 250 index from March 21.</p>
<p>The SBF said it was withdrawing Roussel Uclaf from the stock indices after Hoechst bought out minority shareholders earlier this month to hold 99 percent of the shares.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
